\description{
\code{PipeOpCalibrationTuneFirstOOF} first \strong{hyper-parameter tunes} an
\code{mlr3tuning::AutoTuner} on the full training task and subsequently
performs \strong{out-of-fold (OOF) probability calibration} on the tuned base
learner by concatenating the OOF predictions of all resampling folds and
fitting \strong{one single} calibration model.
Hence it combines the predictive performance of a tuned learner with the
\emph{average-then-calibrate} strategy of
\code{\link{PipeOpCalibrationOOF}}, i.e.~low-variance global calibration.

Supported methods:
\itemize{
\item \strong{Platt scaling} (\code{"platt"}, logistic regression),
